
### Register a user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "password": "TestPass123!"
}

### Login with the same credentials
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "password": "TestPass123!"
}
